## Corpus

The Executive Regulations of the Saudi Personal Data Protection Law are an
official publication of SDAIA. They are reproduced here in extracted form for
research purposes. The source document itself is not redistributed
(data/raw/ is untracked); data/raw/SOURCES.md records its origin and the date
it was retrieved. The official published text is the only authoritative
reference.

